# No local secrets are required for the public Worker routes.
# After uploading the fine-tune, enable its use locally with:
# CHAT_PROVIDER=cloudflare
# CLOUDFLARE_CHAT_MODEL=@cf/google/gemma-2b-it-lora
# CLOUDFLARE_LORA_ID=replace-with-finetune-id-or-name
# To enable the protected adapter upload endpoint locally, set these in .dev.vars:
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=your-token-with-Workers-AI-Write
# ZAZO_ADMIN_UPLOAD_TOKEN=choose-a-long-random-admin-secret
